    body: `<section class="section-anchor" id="layers"><h2>平台分层</h2><div class="doc-table-wrap"><table class="doc-table"><thead><tr><th>层</th><th>职责</th><th>入口</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Hardware</strong></td><td>机械、电气、关节模组和装配过程</td><td><a href="#hardware" data-page="hardware">RP1_hardware</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>URDF、MJCF、网格和机器人配置</td><td><a href="#hardware" data-page="hardware">RP1_description</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Runtime</strong></td><td>IMU、电机、灵巧手、相机和推理模块</td><td><a href="#deployment" data-page="deployment">RP1_deploy</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Learning</strong></td><td>行走、模仿、跟踪与行为策略</td><td><a href="#learning" data-page="learning">RP1_train</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="section-anchor" id="configurations"><h2>机器人配置</h2><p>当前总览库列出四种典型配置，模型文件与支持状态以产品仓库的发布内容为准。</p><div class="resource-list"><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>24 DoF</span><span>01</span></div><p>24 自由度基础配置。</p></div><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>28 DoF</span><span>02</span></div><p>固定头部配置。</p></div><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>30 DoF</span><span>03</span></div><p>搭载 2 自由度运动头部。</p></div><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>42 DoF</span><span>04</span></div><p>2 自由度头部与双 RPhand。</p></div></div></section><section class="section-anchor" id="metrics"><h2>关键数字</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><strong>500 Hz</strong><span>实时控制频率</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>24–42</strong><span>典型自由度范围</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>5+</strong><span>核心运行模块</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>3</strong><span>学习方向入口</span></div></div></section>`,
