    body: `<section class="section-anchor" id="firmware"><h2>底层固件</h2><p>固件层包含 Linux BSP、USB-CAN 桥接、底层 SDK 与软件包源码，是连接计算板和执行器的基础层。</p><div class="media-row"><figure><img src="assets/rp1-deploy.gif" alt="RP1 部署运行模块" /><figcaption>运行模块与设备连接</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="assets/rp1-hardware.gif" alt="RP1 计算板和硬件" /><figcaption>底层硬件与接口</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="section-anchor" id="deploy"><h2>运行时模块</h2><p>运行时覆盖 <span class="inline-code">imu</span>、<span class="inline-code">motor</span>、<span class="inline-code">dexhand</span>、<span class="inline-code">inference</span> 和 <span class="inline-code">camera</span> 等模块。</p><div class="doc-table-wrap"><table class="doc-table"><thead><tr><th>模块</th><th>职责</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>imu</code></td><td>读取与发布惯性测量数据</td></tr><tr><td><code>motor</code></td><td>执行器通信、状态和命令</td></tr><tr><td><code>inference</code></td><td>加载策略并提供推理运行时</td></tr><tr><td><code>camera</code></td><td>采集与整理视觉输入</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="section-anchor" id="flow"><h2>部署流程</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><strong>01</strong><span>连接设备</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>02</strong><span>启动底层</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>03</strong><span>检查反馈</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>04</strong><span>加载策略</span></div></div><div class="callout"><div class="callout-mark">●</div><div>建议让“设备检查”和“策略执行”成为两个独立命令，方便在真实硬件上进行逐步验证。</div></div></section>`,
