    toc: [['directions', '学习方向'], ['pipeline', '训练到部署'], ['train-assets', '数据与资产']],
    body: `<section class="section-anchor" id="directions"><h2>学习方向</h2><div class="resource-list"><a class="resource-card" href="https://github.com/Roboparty/rptest_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>训练与算法</span><span>↗</span></div><p>行走与跑步、运动模仿和行为基础模型。</p><small>产品材料仓库</small></a><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>BeyondMimic</span><span>01</span></div><p>舞蹈与全身运动模仿。</p><small>运动生成</small></div><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>MimicLite</span><span>02</span></div><p>运动跟踪和实时复现。</p><small>运动跟踪</small></div><div class="resource-card"><div class="resource-card-title"><span>UFO</span><span>03</span></div><p>行为基础模型实验。</p><small>行为策略</small></div></div></section><section class="section-anchor" id="pipeline"><h2>训练到部署</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><strong>1</strong><span>采集或整理数据</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>2</strong><span>仿真与训练</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>3</strong><span>导出策略</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>4</strong><span>硬件验证</span></div></div><p>保持观测结构、动作映射和控制频率一致，才能让仿真策略在真实机器人上得到可解释的行为。</p></section><section class="section-anchor" id="train-assets"><h2>数据与资产</h2><p>训练数据、机器人模型和动作映射应绑定版本。实验记录应包含模型版本、数据版本和策略配置。</p><div class="media-row"><figure><img src="assets/rp1-running.gif" alt="RP1 运行学习策略" /><figcaption>行走与运行策略</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="assets/rp1-gallery.jpg" alt="RP1 真实环境运动测试" /><figcaption>从仿真走向真实环境</figcaption></figure></div></section>`,
